1
00:00:00,305 --> 00:00:01,605
(Leonard:)Where is everything?

2
00:00:01,606 --> 00:00:03,606
(Sheldon:)In my present,
it's in the future.

3
00:00:03,608 --> 00:00:06,208
(Sheldon:)In your present,
it's been crammed in the bedroom

4
00:00:06,211 --> 00:00:07,641
(Sheldon:)by an enterprising young man

5
00:00:07,645 --> 00:00:10,585
(Sheldon:)I met in The Home Depot
parking lot.

6
00:00:11,616 --> 00:00:13,116
(Leonard:)I know what you're doing.

7
00:00:13,118 --> 00:00:15,218
(Leonard:)You're trying to get attention
so we'll feel bad for you,

8
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,690
(Leonard:)but it's not happening.

9
00:00:16,688 --> 00:00:18,558
(Sheldon:)No, what I'm doing
is trying to figure out

10
00:00:18,556 --> 00:00:21,156
(Sheldon:)how to live my life now
that everyone is leaving me.

11
00:00:21,159 --> 00:00:23,429
(Leonard:)Will you knock it off?
We're across the hall.

12
00:00:23,428 --> 00:00:26,298
(Sheldon:)As the kids are saying today,
"talk to the hand."

13
00:00:27,732 --> 00:00:29,732
(Penny:)They're not saying that.

14
00:00:29,734 --> 00:00:32,804
(Sheldon:)They are in 2003.

15
00:00:32,804 --> 00:00:35,474
(Penny:)No, they're really not.

16
00:00:38,143 --> 00:00:40,973
♪ Thor and Dr. Jones ♪

17
00:00:40,979 --> 00:00:43,489
♪ Thor and Dr. Jones ♪

18
00:00:43,495 --> 00:00:45,025
♪ One runs from Loki ♪

19
00:00:45,030 --> 00:00:48,570
♪ The other runs from stones. ♪

20
00:00:49,367 --> 00:00:51,637
(Raj(singing):)So, what do you think?

21
00:00:51,636 --> 00:00:53,736
(Emily:)Wow.

22
00:00:53,738 --> 00:00:56,708
(Raj:)Runs from stones means
that-that big boulder,

23
00:00:56,708 --> 00:00:58,978
(Raj:)but I couldn't rhyme anything
with boulder.

24
00:00:58,977 --> 00:01:01,407
(Emily:)Colder, shoulder,

